        The Forensic Mechanics of Foreign Exchange (FX) Spread Gouging in Global Payroll
      </h2>
      <p>
        As modern technology organizations scale distributed engineering, product, and customer success teams globally, Employer of Record (EOR) platforms like Remote.com, Deel, Oyster HR, and Papaya Global have become default infrastructure. Their primary value proposition is regulatory simplicity: founders can hire full-time personnel across 150+ legal jurisdictions without registering foreign corporate subsidiaries or navigating foreign labor statutes.
